    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Techniques to decrease forgetfulness and to increase understanding are now abandoned because of the use of modern technology. Research shows that writing notes by hand materially deepens learner understanding, memory, and the ability to successfully apply that knowledge in the future. However, learning applications are increasingly delivered on the computer. MagNote is designed to take advantage of next-generation technologies and to take best of both writing and typing note taking methods in order to improve learning.",
